Copy-engine test backend
========================

This out-of-tree module is a CPU stand-in for the mechanism copy-engine
provider. It uses a vmalloc window and memcpy in a workqueue. It exercises
CE plan validation, completion classification, ownership and quarantine;
it does not establish GPU DMA execution or hardware performance.

Build against a matching xdev_ext kernel with CONFIG_XDEV_EXT_MECH_CE=y.
The Makefile produces xdev_ext_ce_sim.ko. The integration guest harness
builds and loads this module inside its isolated guest.

Existing module parameters select the window and segment sizes, delayed
completion (delay_us), and fail_mode=none, pre_submit or ambiguous.
Ambiguous completion deliberately retains resources; use a fresh guest for
that failure case. See the repository testing guide for evidence checks.
